[{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0021","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49138","title":"Linux 内核 Bluetooth 子系统 HCI 事件处理安全漏洞","description":"Linux 内核蓝牙子系统（hci_event）中存在空指针解引用漏洞。当蓝牙控制器针对同一连接句柄重复发送多次连接完成事件时，内核会重复注册设备，导致内存损坏。具有低权限的攻击者在相邻网络范围内可通过特制蓝牙数据包触发此漏洞，造成系统崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核版本 2.6.27 至 5.17.3，CVSS 评分 5.7，危害等级中危。Linux 内核社区已通过引入 HCI_CONN_HANDLE_UNSET 标识和句柄合法性检查机制修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49138"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-02-26T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.10.110 及以上版本（或 5.15.33 及以上、5.16.19 及以上、5.17.2 及以上），该修复已合入主线。若无法立即升级，可禁用蓝牙模块（rmmod btusb）或通过内核启动参数添加 `btdisable=1` 作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f619ecf484fdb11d96af754b241cfa934df131f9/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49138.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49138.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49138","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49138.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49138.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-79x7-rvwv-cm9m/GHSA-79x7-rvwv-cm9m.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49138.html","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49138","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-67673.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--90b3e67e-963e-4b82-99a2-ed1c6c8c33d9.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0013","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49063","title":"Linux kernel ice 驱动 aRFS 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Intel ice（Ethernet Connection）网卡驱动的加速接收流引导（aRFS）功能中存在释放后使用漏洞（CWE-416）。由于 free_irq_cpu_rmap() 函数在 (devm_)free_irq() 释放中断描述符之后才被调用，导致驱动在设备重置过程中操作已释放的内存对象，触发内核 KASAN 检测到释放后读取。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞导致系统崩溃或实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 5.8 至 5.17.3 版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高危。Linux 内核社区已在 5.17.4 及后续稳定版本中修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49063"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2025-02-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至包含以下任意一个修复提交的版本：主线内核 ≥ 5.18，或 5.17.x 升级至 5.17.4 及以上，5.15.x 升级至 5.15.184 及以上，5.10.x 升级至 5.10.238 及以上。Debian 11 用户应安装包含该补丁的内核更新。修复提交包括：ba2f6ec28733、618df75f2e30、d08d2fb6d99d、d7442f512b71。如无法立即升级，可在 /etc/modprobe.d/ 中添加 blacklist ice 禁用 ice 网卡驱动作为临时缓解措施，但将导致该网卡不可用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/618df75f2e30c7838a3e010ca32cd4893ec9fe33","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ba2f6ec28733fb6b24ed086e676df3df4c138f3f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d08d2fb6d99d82da1c63aba5c0d1c6f237e150f3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d7442f512b71fc63a99c8a801422dde4fbbf9f93","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/10/msg00007.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2022/CVE-2022-49063.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49063.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49063","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49063.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49063.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/637a4a03e5e4a888b83fa1f62d45bf4fe1e3aa82/2022/CVE-2022-49063.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CveServices-CVE-2022-49063-2025-11-03-1136","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-9hrg-vg64-94qj/GHSA-9hrg-vg64-94qj.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49063","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/b12a3087213f1a0ba1ee8163a8b82d308852db5f/references/contrib1-CveServices-CVE-2022-49063-2025-11-03-1136"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0012","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49043","title":"libxml2 xmlXIncludeAddNode 使用后释放漏洞","description":"libxml2 的 xmlXIncludeAddNode 函数在处理 XInclude 包含关系时存在释放后重用漏洞（CWE-416）。当应用程序使用 libxml2 解析特制的 XML 文档时，由于内存管理不当，攻击者可通过构造恶意的 XML/XInclude 内容触发已释放内存的访问，导致拒绝服务或潜在的内存信息泄露。该漏洞影响 libxml2 2.11.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。建议用户升级至 libxml2 2.11.0 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49043"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-26T06:15:21Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:16:55Z","remediation":"升级 libxml2 至 2.11.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了 xmlXIncludeAddNode 中的释放后使用漏洞。如无法立即升级，可禁用 XML XInclude 功能（设置环境变量 XML_XINCLUDE_DISABLE=1）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/php/php-src/issues/17467","https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libxml2/-/commit/5a19e21605398cef6a8b1452477a8705cb41562b","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/02/msg00028.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2022/CVE-2022-49043.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6acfb9cecc7e37f5bf14164f693abec3417aeb06/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49043.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/b7272967d4cf0923f79d101c86e7ecac005fe400/doc/2025-02/%E3%80%90%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E9%A2%84%E8%AD%A6%E3%80%91libxml2%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2022-49043).md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/8abbbbfccc62b03a7c5dde9955bcc61f3c1b4ea9/osv/cve/2022/UBUNTU-CVE-2022-49043.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2022-49043","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49043.json","https://github.com/oracle/container-images/blob/8565eaa62aafb53d02b5e81ceb929e20e6d81fc0/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/b12a3087213f1a0ba1ee8163a8b82d308852db5f/references/contrib1-CveServices-CVE-2022-49043-2025-11-03-1455","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/637a4a03e5e4a888b83fa1f62d45bf4fe1e3aa82/2022/CVE-2022-49043.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49043.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0011","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-48716","title":"Linux ASoC wcd938x 音频编解码器驱动越界写入漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ASoC 子系统中 wcd938x 音频编解码器驱动存在数组越界访问漏洞。混音器控件错误地将通道 ID 用作端口 ID，而非从 chan_info 数组中正确推导端口 ID，导致访问 port_map 数组时越界并破坏 wcd938x_sdw_priv 结构体。本地攻击者可通过精心构造的音频操作触发此漏洞，造成系统崩溃或潜在权限提升。该漏洞影响使用 wcd938x 驱动的 Linux 内核相关版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-48716"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2024-06-20T11:15:55Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:16:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 5.15.22、5.16.8 或 5.17 及以上版本，该漏洞已在对应稳定分支中修复。补丁提交位于 sound/soc/codecs/wcd938x.c，修复了 mixer 控制中错误使用 channel id 代替 port id 导致的数组越界访问问题。如无法立即升级内核，可临时禁用 wcd938x 声卡编解码器驱动模块（`modprobe -r snd-soc-wcd938x`），但会丧失音频功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9167f2712dc8c24964840a4d1e2ebf130e846b95","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/aa7152f9f117b3e66b3c0d4158ca4c6d46ab229f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c5c1546a654f613e291a7c5d6f3660fc1eb6d0c7","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6acfb9cecc7e37f5bf14164f693abec3417aeb06/cves/2022/48xxx/CVE-2022-48716.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-48716.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-48716","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/48xxx/CVE-2022-48716.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/8abbbbfccc62b03a7c5dde9955bcc61f3c1b4ea9/osv/cve/2022/UBUNTU-CVE-2022-48716.json","https://github.com/AwwMann99/VulneRAG/blob/09adf154d3574ffded6af925a6311b0a20df9db0/docs/Cve_Data/cve_md/CVE-2022-48716.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2022-48716-asoc-codecs-wcd938x-fix-incorrect-u-1771406584000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2024/06/GHSA-qc27-qr34-95w5/GHSA-qc27-qr34-95w5.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-48716","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-48716.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0009","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-33065","title":"Libsndfile libsndfile 整数溢出漏洞","description":"libsndfile 1.2.2 中存在多处有符号整数溢出漏洞，位于 src/au.c 的 au_read_header 函数以及 src/mat4.c 的 mat4_open 和 mat4_read_header 函数中。在 WAV 和 AIFF 文件格式处理路径中，samplesperblock 与 blocks 的 32 位乘法运算在赋值给 sf.frames（int64 类型）前发生整数溢出，导致错误的帧计数，进而引发堆缓冲区溢出或拒绝服务。攻击者可通过构造特制的音频文件触发该漏洞，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-33065"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2023-07-18T14:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T04:48:25Z","remediation":"建议升级 libsndfile 至 1.2.1 及以上版本（1.2.1 已修复 WAV 相关整数溢出 bug，1.2.2 为最新稳定版）。如无法立即升级，在解析不可信音频文件前应严格校验 WAV 文件头中 samplesperblock 和 blocks 字段的乘积不超过 INT_MAX，并启用地址 sanitizer（ASAN）作为运行时防护。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/libsndfile/libsndfile/issues/789","https://github.com/libsndfile/libsndfile/issues/833","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2022/CVE-2022-33065.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6acfb9cecc7e37f5bf14164f693abec3417aeb06/cves/2022/33xxx/CVE-2022-33065.json","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/ac8a4482be8149caa5339386131b703cddd8ca35/upstream-layers/openembedded-core/meta/recipes-multimedia/libsndfile/libsndfile1/cve-2022-33065.patch","https://github.com/OpenIndiana/oi-userland/blob/f609e9ede6df30f752a3f12ac7881fdfb307540e/components/library/libsndfile/patches/CVE-2022-33065.patch","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/8abbbbfccc62b03a7c5dde9955bcc61f3c1b4ea9/osv/cve/2022/UBUNTU-CVE-2022-33065.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ccf2cc3d762789b06638ba5aa3e06982a53080c8/conan/libsndfile/CVE-2022-33065.yml","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2022-33065","https://github.com/NVIDIA/DALI_deps/blob/74597b3bc1688ef9d6fc419535af21235173afc7/patches/libsnd-CVE-2022-33065.patch","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/5ced4caf62e3feb336b842e76f05d0a4122d2224/packages/libs/libsndfile/libsndfile-CVE-2022-33065.patch","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-33065.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0010","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-4743","title":"SDL SDL2 内存泄漏拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SDL2 图像渲染库中的 GLES_CreateTexture() 函数存在内存泄漏漏洞（CWE-401），由于未正确释放已分配的内存资源，远程攻击者可通过向使用 SDL2 的应用程序发送特制的纹理数据触发该漏洞，导致目标系统内存资源被耗尽，从而引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 SDL2 v2.0.4 及以上版本，SDL-1.x 不受影响，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-4743"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2023-01-12T19:15:24Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:21:42Z","remediation":"建议升级 SDL2 至 2.26.0 或更高版本，该版本已在 commit 00b67f55 中修复 GLES_CreateTexture 函数中 glGenTextures/glTexImage2D 失败时未释放 pixels 内存的问题。Debian 用户可通过 LTS 更新安装补丁，Gentoo 用户执行 emerge --oneshot >=media-libs/libsdl2-2.26.0。如无法升级，避免在 OpenGL ES 环境下使用 SDL2 处理流纹理作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2022-4743","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2156290","https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/commit/00b67f55727bc0944c3266e2b875440da132ce4b","https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/pull/6269","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2023/02/msg00008.html","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/202305-18","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/11/msg00024.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6acfb9cecc7e37f5bf14164f693abec3417aeb06/cves/2022/4xxx/CVE-2022-4743.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2022/CVE-2022-47436.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/8abbbbfccc62b03a7c5dde9955bcc61f3c1b4ea9/osv/cve/2022/UBUNTU-CVE-2022-4743.json","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2022-4743","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-4743.json","https://github.com/queens-satellite-team/yocto/blob/25f80e05758cdb8371b1eac30bc9d3da55aab20a/layers/poky/meta/recipes-graphics/libsdl2/libsdl2/CVE-2022-4743.patch","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/47xxx/CVE-2022-47437.json","https://github.com/odakris/datamining_avis_alerte_anssi/blob/68f8d32c3ce9283810a1afd72fa8622c681b3403/datamining_data/first/CVE-2022-4743","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2022/CVE-2022-47435.md","https://github.com/gentoo-mirror/gentoo/blob/7dad538d3e0b5363641b189c79507acb995d5adc/metadata/glsa/glsa-202305-18.xml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0010.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0008","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-47945","title":"ThinkPHP 多语言功能文件包含及远程代码执行漏洞","description":"ThinkPHP 6.0.14 之前版本的多语言功能存在本地文件包含漏洞。当启用语言包功能（lang_switch_on=true）时，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 lang 参数传递包含路径遍历序列的特制参数，配合 pearcmd.php 等内置 PHP 文件实现任意操作系统命令执行，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害严重。该漏洞影响 ThinkPHP 6.0.x 系列所有版本，已公开存在利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-47945","NUCLEI-HTTP-CNVD-2022-CNVD-2022-86535-YAML"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2022-12-23T00:00:00Z","updated":"2023-01-15T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 ThinkPHP 框架至 6.0.14 或更高版本，或禁用多语言功能：修改 config/app.php 中 'lang_switch_on' => false。如无法升级，在入口文件 public/index.php 中增加 lang 参数白名单过滤，仅允许合法的语言值（如 zh-cn、en-us），防止路径穿越字符传入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/top-think/framework/commit/c4acb8b4001b98a0078eda25840d33e295a7f099","https://github.com/top-think/framework/compare/v6.0.13v6.0.14","https://tttang.com/archive/1865/"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0007","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0007.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"strukturag libde265 1.0.8 越界写入拒绝服务漏洞","description":"libde265 v1.0.8 版本在处理特制的 HEVC 视频文件时，sao.cc 文件中的 apply_sao_internal 函数存在段错误（SEGV）漏洞。该漏洞源于样本自适应偏移（SAO）滤波过程中对内存边界缺乏正确校验，导致越界内存读取，当使用 dec265 解码器解析恶意构造的视频流时触发崩溃。攻击者可通过构造特制的 HEVC 视频文件，诱导受害者使用受影响版本解码器解析，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 libde265 库的广泛集成场景，包括多媒体播放器、图像处理软件等依赖该库的应用程序。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["NUCLEI-HTTP-CNVD-2022-CNVD-2022-43245-YAML"],"sources":["cve","nuclei"],"published":"2022-11-02T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 libde265 至 v1.0.9 或更高版本。Debian 10/11 用户请参考 DSA-5346 通过 apt update && apt upgrade 更新系统 libde265 软件包。对于自行编译集成的应用，应从 strukturag/libde265 仓库获取并应用修复提交，重新编译部署。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/strukturag/libde265/issues/352","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2023/01/msg00020.html","https://www.debian.org/security/2023/dsa-5346"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0004","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-37700","title":"易软天创禅道路径遍历漏洞","description":"Zentao 禅道项目管理软件存在目录遍历漏洞，攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求访问 `index.php?mode=getconfig` 接口，绕过路径限制读取系统敏感配置文件，导致数据库账号、密钥等关键信息泄露。该漏洞影响禅道 Demo15 及可能的相关版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-37700"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2022-09-19T16:15:11Z","updated":"2026-07-09T01:17:38Z","remediation":"将禅道开源版升级至 17.0 及以上版本（当前最新版为 22.3），该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）层面添加规则，阻止对 `/zentao/index.php?mode=getconfig` 路径的未授权外部访问，同时限制 `mode` 参数仅接受白名单值，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://demo15.zentao.pm/user-login.html/zentao/index.php?mode=getconfig","https://medium.com/@sc0p3hacker/cve-2022-37700-directory-transversal-in-zentao-easy-soft-alm-2573c1f0fc21","https://medium.com/%40sc0p3hacker/cve-2022-37700-directory-transversal-in-zentao-easy-soft-alm-2573c1f0fc21","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2022-37700"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0006","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0006.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"禅道 项目管理软件前台SQL注入漏洞","description":"禅道（ZenTaoPMS）项目管理软件存在前台SQL注入漏洞。漏洞位于 framework/base/router.class.php 文件的 setVision() 函数中，程序未对通过 GET/POST 传入的 account 参数进行过滤校验，直接拼接到 SQL 语句中执行。未经认证的远程攻击者可通过向 index.php 的 account 参数传递恶意 payload 触发延时注入，实现数据库信息窃取。该漏洞影响禅道开源版16.5及beta1、企业版6.5及beta1、旗舰版3.0及beta1，属于高危 SQL 注入漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["NUCLEI-HTTP-CNVD-2022-CNVD-2022-42853-YAML","CNVD-2022-42853"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2022-07-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2022-07-26T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将禅道项目管理系统升级至官方最新开源版（建议 18.x 及以上）或对应商业版最新补丁版本，确保登录模块已对 account 参数做严格过滤与参数化查询；升级前在 WAF/反向代理上拦截对 /zentao/user-login.html 请求体中含 updatexml、extractvalue、concat、and 等 SQL 注入特征的 account 载荷；临时可限制该登录接口仅内网或经 VPN 访问，并关闭对外匿名登录入口，同时审计登录与数据库访问日志排查是否已被利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cnvd/2022/CNVD-2022-42853.yaml","https://github.com/z92g/ZentaoSqli","https://www.cnvd.org.cn/flaw/show/CNVD-2022-42853"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0050","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0050.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-22965","title":"Spring Framework 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Spring Framework 存在远程代码执行漏洞，当应用运行在 JDK 9+ 版本并以 WAR 包形式部署在 Tomcat 容器上时，攻击者可通过数据绑定功能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Spring Framework 5.3.18 之前版本和 5.2.20 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者无需认证即可利用此漏洞获取服务器控制权，可能导致数据泄露、系统被完全控制等严重后果。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2022-22965"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2022-04-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Spring Framework 至 5.3.18 或 5.2.20 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可采取以下缓解措施：1) 将应用从 WAR 包部署改为 Spring Boot 可执行 jar 包部署；2) 降级 JDK 版本至 8 或更低版本；3) 配置 Tomcat 禁用数据绑定功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T12:04:34Z","references":["https://tanzu.vmware.com/security/cve-2022-22965","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2022-22965","https://spring.io/blog/2022/03/31/spring-framework-rce-early-announcement"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0050.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0005","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0005.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"Wuzhicms 4.1.0 SQL注入漏洞","description":"Wuzhicms 4.1.0版本中www/api/sms_check.php文件存在SQL注入漏洞。攻击者可通过GET请求中的param参数直接传入恶意SQL语句，由于程序未对用户输入进行有效过滤和转义，导致攻击者可利用updatexml等函数进行报错注入，从而获取数据库敏感信息、修改数据或在受影响站点上下文中执行未授权管理操作。攻击无需身份认证，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["NUCLEI-HTTP-CNVD-2022-CNVD-2022-36985-YAML","CNVD-2022-36985"],"sources":["nuclei","cnvd"],"published":"2022-03-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2022-08-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级Wuzhicms至最新版本；对api/sms_check.php中param参数进行严格的输入过滤和参数化查询处理，避免直接将用户输入拼接至SQL语句中。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T21:12:12Z","references":["https://github.com/wuzhicms/wuzhicms/issues/184","https://vulners.com/cnvd/CNVD-2022-36985"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0005.toml"}]